### ② My Misconception

**Before:** I thought that any program with two nested loops would have a time complexity of O(n²).

**Now:** I understand that nested loops do not always mean O(n²). The time complexity depends on how many times each loop runs. If the inner loop runs a constant number of times, the overall time complexity can be O(n).

